# dbt

- Models: `stg_`, `int_`, `fct_`, `dim_` layer prefixes; `{layer}_{source}__{entity}.sql`.
- Exception: product reco marts stay as `match_*` in `public` schema.
- Co-located `*.yml` per model with generic tests (`not_null`, `unique`, `relationships`).
- Custom SQL tests in `dbt/tests/` for business rules only.
- One-sentence `description` per model in YAML.
